Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: enable CoreSight on the stm32mp135f-dk board

Enable CoreSight peripherals on the stm32mp135f-dk board.

Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I0a8994a84d3aebf6005b987912bd07bc7d559987
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/530871
